Subject: [PATCH 33/52] patch: Add XML patch list and Patch Manager (#4259)

* patch: Add XML patch list and Patch Manager

Load patchlist.xml entries keyed by title ID, version and NID.
Add a Qt Patch Manager (Manage menu) with patch list download.
Log the main executable NID on launch for the NID attribute.

(cherry picked from commit 09acf4a68b0bd02910600b67f206a4994e8b856e)
